%% Figure: Emergency report submission and response workflow.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/emergency-workflow.png
flowchart TD
    A["Citizen submits an emergency report and media"] --> B["Relayer verifies government ticket, image hashes, and citizen signature"]
    B --> C["AI moderation checks safety, spam, and civic relevance"]
    C --> D{"Content accepted?"}
    D -- No --> E["Reject submission"]
    D -- Yes --> F["Accepted content stored as one IPFS envelope"]
    F --> G["EmergencyReporting contract records the report directly as Open"]
    G --> H["Community validation is skipped so response can start immediately"]
    H --> I{"Authority assessment"}
    I -- "Genuine, needs work" --> J["Authority starts work: InProgress"]
    J --> K["Authority resolves the emergency: Resolved"]
    I -- "Genuine, already fixed" --> L["Authority resolves directly from Open: Resolved"]
    I -- "False emergency" --> M["Authority reclassifies the report: Reclassified"]
    M --> N["Citizen pseudonym enters a 30-day emergency penalty box"]
    N --> O["New emergency submissions from that pseudonym resume after the penalty period"]
